    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταβουλ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>alter one's plans, change one's mind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.286
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1526
			</span></i> (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἄνω καὶ κάτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Epin.</u>
					982d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ὥστε μένειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.57
				</span></i>
			: c. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή</span> et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ δὴ βουλεύεαι στράτευμα μὴ ἄγειν
					ἐπὶ τὴν Ἑλλάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.12
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>repent of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τῆς ἀφίξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					2.4.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
